'''Flying Ninja Cat''' (ムササビネコ忍者 ''Musasabi Neko Ninja'', '''Flying Squirrel Ninja Cat''') is a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemy that appears in [[Special Events|Event Stages]]. She was added in [[Version 3.3 Update|Version 3.3]]. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], she was added in [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.6 Update|Patch 1.0.6]].

