==Trivia==
*Her gender is confirmed by the Caltrops' description in [[The Burgle Cats]]: "Ninja Cat forgot to clean up after herself. Just rubber, but the pointy bits still hurt when stepped on! Imagine if it was actual steel!"
*Her movement animation is identical to Kanzo Hattori's "Flying Squirrel Technique" in [[wikipedia:Ninja Hattori-kun|''Ninja Hattori-kun'']], and her parachute looks just like Hattori's outside of having a swirl-pattern design.
**Incidentally, Hattori is afraid of frogs, which may be why [[Ninja Cat (Special Cat)|Frog Ninja Cat]] only rides another Ninja Cat in a frog mask.
*Flying Ninja Cat and [[Commander Bun Bun]] are the only non-[[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic]], non-collab [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating Enemies]] to have the Floating trait's associated color, green.
*Prior to [[Version 5.10 Update|Version 5.10]], Flying Ninja Cat was a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]]/Floating enemy.

